  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">One cardboard sheet, accordion-folded and cut to form various views of a house, with a story printed on accordion-folded cards mounted on each page which unfold to form a stairway in front of the picture on each page.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"This dimensional, house-shaped book literally unfolds to tell an autobiographical story from the author's childhood." http://www.wsworkshop.org/ (accessed August 27, 2014).</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1="0" ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Item consists of a card folded 5 times. The shape suggests a house, a rectangle is cut from internal four folds (suggesting a fireplace?). Fixed to each internal page is sheet with an image and text: this is folded concertina style so the text is not immediately visible. There are images along the external pages. Item is brown, beige and cream. In a transparent box.</subfield>
  </datafield>
